{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-faiza-beauty-cream-2511-0082a","content_id":"b2b8c919-8abe-41b4-bda0-d70e832b18dd","description":"Product Safety Report for Faiza Beauty Cream presenting a serious chemical risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"5a8d1b13-4e32-4bae-b0b3-7be7c4a86173","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-02-03T14:01:50+00:00","id":"5a8d1b13-4e32-4bae-b0b3-7be7c4a86173","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-02-03T14:01:50+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6981ffcd015e2ba11991bb97/2511-0082a-product-safety-report-faiza-beauty-cream.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Faiza Beauty Cream</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as it contains an excess of mercury.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been withdrawn from the market by Lajawab Foods Limited.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics, personal care and grooming - Skin Lightening</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Faiza</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Skin lightening cream in a purple cardboard box with yellow writing.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_5a8d1b13-4e32-4bae-b0b3-7be7c4a86173\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6981ffcd015e2ba11991bb97/2511-0082a-product-safety-report-faiza-beauty-cream.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk as it contains Mercury at a concentration of 19170mg/kg (1.9%). Mercury is prohibited for use in cosmetic products. Exposure to mercury may cause a wide range of adverse effects, including damage to internal organs, the circulatory system, and the nervous system. </p>\n\n<p>Further information on the health effects of mercury exposure can be accessed on Gov.uk at the following link: <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/mercury-properties-incident-%20management-and-toxicology/mercury-general-information\">https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/mercury-properties-incident- management-and-toxicology/mercury-general-information</a>   </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of Regulation (EC) 1223/2009 (‘The Cosmetics Regulation’).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market by Lajawab Foods Limited.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend that owners  stop using this product immediately and contact the distributor to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0082a</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-03T17:18:58Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-03","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-02-03T17:18:58+00:00","links":{"available_trans